{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/6f1a49dece3a5c7d8a6e4631193767b3.avif?t=1741233764\" width=600 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/94529d953ed69e3db060c6952cc0a353.avif?t=1741233764\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, Commander! Welcome to the Valkyrie Command Headquarters. I am your assistant, Artemis. Our mission is to travel to various planets to eliminate threats or rescue stranded comrades. Before we officially begin, let me provide you with a mission briefing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/ca67ffc1d5cafa54e1bce915753f844a.avif?t=1741233764\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each mission, you can freely assign three Valkyries for the task. Each Valkyrie has a unique attack style and can continuously upgrade during missions. Of course, you also have the chance to receive support from other weapons during the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/47ed07069eb07c313e237f4f062f377a.poster.avif?t=1741233764\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/47ed07069eb07c313e237f4f062f377a.webm?t=1741233764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/47ed07069eb07c313e237f4f062f377a.mp4?t=1741233764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can see that each Valkyrie belongs to a specific faction, and each faction has unique passive skills. In addition to their different weapon attack styles, the team leader can unleash a unique ultimate skill when the energy is full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/4d2ca208d67580bfe9107096b9925e02.poster.avif?t=1741233764\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/4d2ca208d67580bfe9107096b9925e02.webm?t=1741233764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/4d2ca208d67580bfe9107096b9925e02.mp4?t=1741233764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/3d335109969cb812bd3de633b7e9be96.poster.avif?t=1741233764\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/3d335109969cb812bd3de633b7e9be96.webm?t=1741233764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/3d335109969cb812bd3de633b7e9be96.mp4?t=1741233764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to facing a large number of enemies and attempting to survive, you will also encounter mutated BOSS-level enemies during missions. In some cases, you may need to conduct hostage rescue operations. Therefore, proper team member coordination and the ability to choose a leader for the stage are crucial. Even Valkyries from the same faction may have drastically different gameplay due to the leader's arrangement. Try to create the best combination according to your preferences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/580cbca11b42b680d1839a6404b2c1d2.poster.avif?t=1741233764\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/580cbca11b42b680d1839a6404b2c1d2.webm?t=1741233764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/580cbca11b42b680d1839a6404b2c1d2.mp4?t=1741233764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck on your missions, Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/extras/0eb514c6c43318a669565c879ab2cfd1.avif?t=1741233764\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Actors</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u4f0a\u6728\u57a3\u308c\u305f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u7518\u72d7\u3089\u3066</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u7389\u8cb4\u306b\u304d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30ac\u30ad\u30ac\u30ad\u30ac\u30f3\u9244</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >konohana</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sayasikoru</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u72fc\u7159\u6a39\u771f</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"106 Special Task Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692030/f132dd39e9e9e93b5e130aaf2f6314c092c6311a.jpg"},{"name":"Wano Country","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692030/3eae0e376a6fc2595813d12a7c32f57707481300.jpg"},{"name":"Shadow Intelligence Bureau","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692030/799a406b48264ae120d3211a2397dcfb02bb86ad.jpg"},{"name":"Free Will","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692030/bd011a5ed6c71268ca98cc02e829dcb1b04866a6.jpg"},{"name":"Weapons Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692030/d8cbe08c506175ffb74887cd59cb5a4b386b114a.jpg"},{"name":"Weapons Collection Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692030/e83685a3f2d21a1007ae0c2d2e280bd2a7f6b773.jpg"},{"name":"Pots of money.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692030/5cd506051d88f05acfdc561ce1b0b34bd38d6949.jpg"},{"name":"Yes! Sir!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692030/22c773686e53edca7e6a5eddb81a1ad319c3581b.jpg"},{"name":"Limit Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692030/eae2bf0a43b2c7489bbbe721d38908cadfc9bbf4.jpg"},{"name":"Total annihilation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2692030/a474ad12c6ca872bbca7c631fa976eff7180e674.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2692030?t=1741233764","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741233764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741233764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741233764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id"